{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39698","headline":"寄蒋先辈 · 黄滔","name":"寄蒋先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夫差宫苑悉苍苔，携客朝游夜未回。\n塚上题诗苏小见，江头酹酒伍员来。\n秋风急处烟花落，明月中时水寺开。\n千载三吴有高迹，虎丘山翠益崔嵬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39698.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39698","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}